# Shell scripts must keep LF endings. Editing them from a Windows host through
# the WSL share once wrote CRLF into exitcheck.sh, and bash answered with
# "syntax error near unexpected token" on a line that looked perfectly fine.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Same reasoning, less dramatic failure mode.
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
